            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>This application is applicable to the field of radar technologies, and provides a radar data processing method, a terminal device and a computer-readable storage medium. The method includes: obtaining a target receiving unit group corresponding to an emission unit; obtaining echo data received by the target receiving unit group; converging the echo data to obtain a convergence result; and determining a distance of a target object based on the convergence result. A target receiving unit with mapping offset is covered, to receive the echo data, and then a plurality pieces of received echo data is converged, to ensure complete reception of an echo signal. Then, ranging is performed based on converged data, to accurately obtain a position of a target object, thereby solving a problem that a receiving unit in existing LiDAR cannot effectively receive an echo and the target object cannot be detected due to a corresponding transceiving relationship.</p>
            </abstract>
